- **`DeleteUser_RemovesFromDatabase`** — Classic arrange → act → assert with a single clear assertion (`Assert.IsNull`). Exactly one behavior tested.
- **`UpdateUser_ModifiesExistingRecord`** — Clean setup of precondition, single mutation, focused assertion.
- **`ListUsers_ReturnsAllInserted`** — Count is self-documenting (3 inserts → assert 3); `CollectionAssert` is idiomatic MSTest.
- **`InsertUser_ConcurrentInserts_MaintainsIntegrity`** — Good integration-level concurrency test with clear verification.

