## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Fix | Effort |
|----------|-------|-----|--------|
| 1 | **Assertion-Free Test** | Add `Assert.AreEqual(100, ...)` to `BulkInsert` | ⚡ 2 min |
| 2 | **Conditional Test Logic** | Split `GetUser_ReturnsCorrectType` into 2 tests | 🔧 10 min |
| 3 | **Sleepy Test** | Replace `Thread.Sleep` with poll-with-timeout | 🔧 10 min |
| 4 | **Assertion Roulette** | Add message params to `InsertUser_PersistsToDatabase` | ⚡ 5 min |

Priorities 1–2 prevent **false passes** (tests that cannot fail). Priority 3 prevents **false failures** (flaky timing). Priority 4 improves **debuggability**.

**Bottom line:** 4 of 8 tests have smells, but none are catastrophic. Fixing priorities 1 and 2 (~12 minutes of work) eliminates all High-severity issues and gives you a solid integration suite.
